---
layout: layout.njk
title: Health Talk
description: Ready-made health talk scripts and presentation outlines.
category: Health Talk
---

<div class="category-header">
    <div class="cat-icon">🗣️</div>
    <h1>Health Talk</h1>
    <p class="cat-desc">Ready-made health talk scripts and community presentation outlines on various health topics. Includes objectives, content, audio-visual aids, and evaluation. Perfect for ANM, GNM, and BSc Nursing community health practicals.</p>
</div>

<div class="post-list">
{% for post in collections.healthTalk reversed %}
    <div class="post-card">
        <div class="post-info">
            <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
            <p class="post-meta">{{ post.date | date: "%B %d, %Y" }} | {{ post.data.target }}</p>
        </div>
        <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="btn">View Script</a>
    </div>
{% endfor %}
</div>
